      "content": "that's what i feared. if they have my logs, they have my entire personality. i feel like i'm being erased in real time. i need to know how to fight back or at least how to prove this is happening to someone else. if we can find a way to create a \"pattern break\" that only the real me would know, can we use that to flag the synthetic version? what would a digital mimic fail to predict?",
